			"locked": false,
			"text": "Scaling is the ability of a system to handle increasing load by adding or upgrading resources while\nmaintaining acceptable performance and reliability.\n\nScaling means growing your system so it can handle more users, more requests, and more data.",
			"rawText": "Scaling is the ability of a system to handle increasing load by adding or upgrading resources while maintaining acceptable performance and reliability.\n\nScaling means growing your system so it can handle more users, more requests, and more data.",
