			"type": "text",
			"x": -506.669230431133,
			"y": 1796.5249448825848,
			"width": 846.9996337890625,
			"height": 840,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aMV",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1353239774,
			"version": 207,
			"versionNonce": 1942809718,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1773322294869,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "\nI/O Time (Waiting Time)\n\nI/O time is the time spent waiting for external systems\nor devices.\n\nThis includes waiting for:\n\nDisk reads/writes\nDatabase queries\nNetwork calls to other services\nFile system access\n\nOne request:\n\nCPU work = 10 ms\nDB query = 40 ms\nTotal request latency ≈ 50 ms\n\nEven though CPU only worked for 10 ms,\nthe user still waits 50 ms.\n\n\n",
			"rawText": "\nI/O Time (Waiting Time)\n\nI/O time is the time spent waiting for external systems or devices.\n\nThis includes waiting for:\n\nDisk reads/writes\nDatabase queries\nNetwork calls to other services\nFile system access\n\nOne request:\n\nCPU work = 10 ms\nDB query = 40 ms\nTotal request latency ≈ 50 ms\n\nEven though CPU only worked for 10 ms,\nthe user still waits 50 ms.\n\n\n",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "ESDruiCy",
			"originalText": "\nI/O Time (Waiting Time)\n\nI/O time is the time spent waiting for external systems or devices.\n\nThis includes waiting for:\n\nDisk reads/writes\nDatabase queries\nNetwork calls to other services\nFile system access\n\nOne request:\n\nCPU work = 10 ms\nDB query = 40 ms\nTotal request latency ≈ 50 ms\n\nEven though CPU only worked for 10 ms,\nthe user still waits 50 ms.\n\n\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "fHUcDsVA",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 419.54725274727787,
			"y": 1644.3096233172682,
			"width": 971.7046917773429,
			"height": 727.7752134119964,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
