		{
			"id": "gmYacYsF",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 424.54725274727787,
			"y": 1675.6972300232665,
			"width": 877.7996215820312,
			"height": 665,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aNV",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1518526530,
			"version": 196,
			"versionNonce": 596166390,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1773322294869,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Memory\n\nMemory is RAM used to store data while the application is\nrunning.\n\nMemory is used for:\n\nCaches\nIn-memory objects\nRequest buffers\nSession data\nConnection pools\n\nIf your service caches 5 GB of data in memory,\nand the machine has only 4 GB RAM:\n\nSystem will swap to disk\nLatency will explode\nPerformance will collapse",
			"rawText": "Memory\n\nMemory is RAM used to store data while the application is running.\n\nMemory is used for:\n\nCaches\nIn-memory objects\nRequest buffers\nSession data\nConnection pools\n\nIf your service caches 5 GB of data in memory,\nand the machine has only 4 GB RAM:\n\nSystem will swap to disk\nLatency will explode\nPerformance will collapse",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "fHUcDsVA",
			"originalText": "Memory\n\nMemory is RAM used to store data while the application is running.\n\nMemory is used for:\n\nCaches\nIn-memory objects\nRequest buffers\nSession data\nConnection pools\n\nIf your service caches 5 GB of data in memory,\nand the machine has only 4 GB RAM:\n\nSystem will swap to disk\nLatency will explode\nPerformance will collapse",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "fXU3RxRq1Lqdcyin-vmFl",
			"type": "rectangle",
