		{
			"id": "LGHPmsTd",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -502.11238354051045,
			"y": 2735.075536848787,
			"width": 723.7996826171875,
			"height": 630,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aP",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 2010547998,
			"version": 171,
			"versionNonce": 1559232886,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1773322294869,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Disk I/O\n\nDisk I/O is reading or writing data to storage.\n\nDisk is much slower than memory.\n\nTypical speeds (rough):\n\nRAM: nanoseconds\nSSD: microseconds to milliseconds\nHDD: milliseconds to tens of ms\n\nExample:\n\nIf each request writes a log entry to disk:\nDisk becomes busy\nRequests start waiting\nLatency increases",
			"rawText": "Disk I/O\n\nDisk I/O is reading or writing data to storage.\n\nDisk is much slower than memory.\n\nTypical speeds (rough):\n\nRAM: nanoseconds\nSSD: microseconds to milliseconds\nHDD: milliseconds to tens of ms\n\nExample:\n\nIf each request writes a log entry to disk:\nDisk becomes busy\nRequests start waiting\nLatency increases",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "fXU3RxRq1Lqdcyin-vmFl",
			"originalText": "Disk I/O\n\nDisk I/O is reading or writing data to storage.\n\nDisk is much slower than memory.\n\nTypical speeds (rough):\n\nRAM: nanoseconds\nSSD: microseconds to milliseconds\nHDD: milliseconds to tens of ms\n\nExample:\n\nIf each request writes a log entry to disk:\nDisk becomes busy\nRequests start waiting\nLatency increases",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "JXBQjvqWxi2PeeVi2hB6J",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 426.7340818748004,
			"y": 2414.8307310413443,
			"width": 963.9138767611913,
			"height": 995.7855945872452,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aQ",
			"roundness": {
				"type": 3
			},
			"seed": 1430570846,
			"version": 1608,
			"versionNonce": 631005878,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [
