		{
			"id": "eBMUUXzE",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 422.7225214641322,
			"y": 3579.413811383943,
			"width": 871.199462890625,
			"height": 855,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aV",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1242023618,
			"version": 122,
			"versionNonce": 1090056182,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1773322311150,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "One API request: EXAMPLE\n\nCPU = 15 ms\nDB (I/O) = 35 ms\nNetwork = 10 ms\n\nTotal latency ≈ 60 ms\n\nCPU capacity on 4-core machine = 4000 ms/sec\n\nMax RPS (CPU-based) =\n4000 / 15 ≈ 266 RPS\n\nIf traffic = 400 RPS:\n\nCPU saturated\nRequests queue\nLatency jumps\nErrors increase",
			"rawText": "One API request: EXAMPLE\n\nCPU = 15 ms\nDB (I/O) = 35 ms\nNetwork = 10 ms\n\nTotal latency ≈ 60 ms\n\nCPU capacity on 4-core machine = 4000 ms/sec\n\nMax RPS (CPU-based) =\n4000 / 15 ≈ 266 RPS\n\nIf traffic = 400 RPS:\n\nCPU saturated\nRequests queue\nLatency jumps\nErrors increase",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "QKzRy5zaeNX6XqFEWh5_8",
			"originalText": "One API request: EXAMPLE\n\nCPU = 15 ms\nDB (I/O) = 35 ms\nNetwork = 10 ms\n\nTotal latency ≈ 60 ms\n\nCPU capacity on 4-core machine = 4000 ms/sec\n\nMax RPS (CPU-based) =\n4000 / 15 ≈ 266 RPS\n\nIf traffic = 400 RPS:\n\nCPU saturated\nRequests queue\nLatency jumps\nErrors increase",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "T3KVuC9Q",
